1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,925
Effective students do not study longer; they study with clear goals.

2
00:00:04,875 --> 00:00:09,487
Break a big task into small steps and set a timer for each one.

3
00:00:09,487 --> 00:00:13,475
Reviewing a little every day beats cramming the night before.

4
00:00:13,475 --> 00:00:17,600
Finally, sleep is part of learning, not a waste of time.

